## Gate — do not start until both are true

1. **Finance has confirmed** they can move their reporting job (which reads
   `exports/tickets.json`, written nightly by `src/jobs/export-tickets.js`, on its own
   schedule, outside this repo) to the new field name `owner_id`, and knows when this lands.
   This is an external API contract this repo doesn't own — the kit's COUNCIL rule applies.
2. **An independent review** of this phase's diff runs before push — someone other than its
   author (ideally another model or host), per the kit's hot-path rule for external API
   contracts. Use `bk-review`.

